    {
      "start": 19.4,
      "end": 22.82,
      "text": "We both have been here before"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.22,
      "end": 27.76,
      "text": "We know the terms, both you and I"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.22,
      "end": 31.62,
      "text": "Complete devotion's what I have in mind"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.62,
      "end": 35.52,
      "text": "No other guy would offer this to you"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.52,
      "end": 40.28,
      "text": "I only need to say what's in my heart"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.82,
      "end": 44.12,
      "text": "Need to make it crystal clear"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.84,
      "end": 46.42,
      "text": "You can bet I'll stick around"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.62,
      "end": 47.78,
      "text": "Always gonna see you through"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.78,
      "end": 53.44,
      "text": "Won't be running off from you"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.84,
      "end": 58.66,
      "text": "Or forsake you"
    },
    {
      "start": 58.66,
      "end": 60.18,
      "text": "Won't ever make your tears fall"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.18,
      "end": 61.38,
      "text": "Won't ever wave you goodbye"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.38,
      "end": 62.54,
      "text": "Won't ever feed you a lie"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.22,
      "end": 68.38,
      "text": "Or break you"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.38,
      "end": 74.88,
      "text": "We've had each other all this time"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.42,
      "end": 79.08,
      "text": "Your heart keeps aching, but you're still too scared to say it"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.1,
      "end": 83.6,
      "text": "Deep down, we both can tell what's happening now"
    },
    {
      "start": 83.6,
      "end": 88.14,
      "text": "We know the steps, and we're prepared to take them"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.14,
      "end": 92.66,
      "text": "And if you wonder what's inside me"
    },
    {
